Slice 050c gap step, 2 edges of the `.del` renames of a tool on Windows (R-ST10, D8, Q-R1). The home is that of `tool/dl2-tool-windows`, with 2 tools: `foo` has its data file and its entry (`foo.exe`, the same text), `bar` has neither (a manifest entry whose files are gone). `fx/rename` says `exists .del`: a `rename!` whose target ends with `.del` gives `Exists` and moves nothing.

